---

---

<section class="workflow" id="metodologia">
  <div class="workflow-content">
    <h2 class="title-section fade-in">Así trabajo: Método CTP</h2>
    <h3 class="subtitle-section fade-in fade-in-delay-1">Estrategia antes que código. Resultados desde la primera etapa.</h3>

    <div class="workflow-diagram">
      <div class="workflow-step__circle workflow-step__circle--1 workflow-item fade-in fade-in-delay-1">
        <span class="workflow-step__number">1</span>
        <div class="workflow-step__icon">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">search</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="workflow-step__title">Diagnóstico de Fricción</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-step__circle workflow-step__circle--2 workflow-item fade-in fade-in-delay-3">
        <span class="workflow-step__number">2</span>
        <div class="workflow-step__icon">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">neurology</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="workflow-step__title">Arquitectura de Control (Cerebro)</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-step__circle workflow-step__circle--3 workflow-item fade-in fade-in-delay-5">
        <span class="workflow-step__number">3</span>
        <div class="workflow-step__icon">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">bolt</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="workflow-step__title">Implementación Ágil (Músculo)</h3>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-step__circle workflow-step__circle--4 workflow-item fade-in fade-in-delay-7">
        <span class="workflow-step__number">4</span>
        <div class="workflow-step__icon">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined">key</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="workflow-step__title">Transferencia de Soberanía</h3>
      </div>

      <!-- Contenidos -->
      <div class="workflow-step__content workflow-step__content--1 workflow-item fade-in fade-in-delay-8">
        <p class="workflow-step__duration">2 HORAS</p>
        <ul class="workflow-step__list">
          <li>Identifico dónde pierdes tiempo y dinero</li>
          <li>Mapeo tus procesos críticos</li>
          <li>Detecto oportunidades de automatización</li>
          <li>Defino objetivos y KPIs claros</li>
          <li>Roadmap inicial personalizado</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-step__content workflow-step__content--2 workflow-item fade-in fade-in-delay-9">
        <p class="workflow-step__duration">1-2 SEMANAS</p>
        <ul class="workflow-step__list">
          <li>Diseño tu estrategia digital</li>
          <li>Documento tus procesos (SOPs)</li>
          <li>Plano técnico antes de programar</li>
          <li>Validación y ajustes contigo</li>
          <li>Hoja de ruta para 90 días</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-step__content workflow-step__content--3 workflow-item fade-in fade-in-delay-10">
        <p class="workflow-step__duration">2-4 SEMANAS</p>
        <ul class="workflow-step__list">
          <li>Desarrollo por etapas incrementales</li>
          <li>Automatizaciones que aportan valor real</li>
          <li>Testing y optimización continua</li>
          <li>Capacitación personalizada</li>
          <li>Puesta en marcha guiada</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-step__content workflow-step__content--4 workflow-item fade-in fade-in-delay-11">
        <p class="workflow-step__duration">CONTINUO</p>
        <ul class="workflow-step__list">
          <li>Tú eres dueño del código y sistema</li>
          <li>Documentación completa entregada</li>
          <li>Mantenimiento proactivo mensual</li>
          <li>Soporte activo y mejoras continuas</li>
          <li>Informes de rendimiento</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Flechas -->
      <div class="workflow-step__arrow workflow-step__arrow--1 workflow-arrow fade-in fade-in-delay-2">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">east</span>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-step__arrow workflow-step__arrow--2 workflow-arrow fade-in fade-in-delay-4">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">east</span>
      </div>

      <div class="workflow-step__arrow workflow-step__arrow--3 workflow-arrow fade-in fade-in-delay-6">
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined">east</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="workflow-footer fade-in fade-in-delay-12" style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="/metodologia" class="btn-cta"><span class="material-symbols-outlined">description</span> Ver metodología completa <span class="material-symbols-outlined ml-1">arrow_forward</span></a>
      <p class="workflow-footer__message" style="margin-top: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--color-text-secondary); font-weight: 500;">
        Sin compromiso &bull; Respuesta en &lt;24h &bull; Diagnóstico inicial gratuito
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.workflow {
  padding: var(--space-xl) 0;
  background-color: var(--color-surface);
}

:global(:root[data-theme="light"]) .workflow {
  --step-bg-1: #ffe0f0;
  --step-bg-2: #e9d5ff;
  --step-bg-3: #ccfff9;
  --step-bg-4: #eeeeee;
  --card-bg: var(--color-white);
  --circle-bg: var(--color-white);
  --card-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
}

:global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .workflow {
  --step-bg-1: rgba(255, 0, 128, 0.08);
  --step-bg-2: rgba(166, 0, 255, 0.08);
  --step-bg-3: rgba(0, 255, 224, 0.06);
  --step-bg-4: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
  --card-bg: var(--color-surface);
  --circle-bg: var(--color-surface-secondary);
  --card-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
}

.workflow-content {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 0 var(--padding-container);
}

@media (min-width: 1200px) {
  .workflow-content { max-width: 1440px; }
}

.workflow-diagram {
  display: grid;
  gap: var(--space-lg);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl);
  grid-template-areas: "circle1" "content1" "arrow1" "circle2" "content2" "arrow2" "circle3" "content3" "arrow3" "circle4" "content4";
  grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  justify-items: center;
}

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .workflow-diagram {
    grid-template-areas: "circle1  arrow1  circle2" "content1 .       content2" ".        arrow2  ." "circle3  arrow3  circle4" "content3 .       content4";
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-md);
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1200px) {
  .workflow-diagram {
    grid-template-areas: "circle1  arrow1  circle2  arrow2  circle3  arrow3  circle4" "content1 .       content2 .       content3 .       content4";
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr;
    grid-template-rows: auto 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-sm);
    align-items: start;
  }
}

.workflow-diagram :global(span.material-symbols-outlined) {
  font-size: min(2em, 40px);
}

.workflow-step__circle {
  --circle-size: clamp(200px, 20vw, 260px);
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: var(--circle-size);
  height: var(--circle-size);
  border-radius: 50%;
  border: 3px solid var(--step-color);
  background-color: var(--circle-bg);
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: var(--space-sm);
  gap: var(--space-xs);
  box-shadow: none;
  text-align: center;
}

.workflow-step__circle--1 { grid-area: circle1; }
.workflow-step__circle--2 { grid-area: circle2; }
.workflow-step__circle--3 { grid-area: circle3; }
.workflow-step__circle--4 { grid-area: circle4; }

.workflow-step__content {
  background-color: var(--card-bg);
  padding: var(--space-lg);
  box-shadow: none;
  transition: all var(--transition-normal) ease;
  border: 2px solid transparent;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  min-height: 280px;
  height: 100%;
}

.workflow-step__content:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
  box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
}

@media (min-width: 820px) {
  .workflow-step__content {
    padding: var(--space-xl);
    min-height: 320px;
  }
}

@media (min-width: 1200px) {
  .workflow-step__content { min-height: 300px; }
}

.workflow-step__content--1 { grid-area: content1; }
.workflow-step__content--2 { grid-area: content2; }
.workflow-step__content--3 { grid-area: content3; }
.workflow-step__content--4 { grid-area: content4; }

.workflow-step__arrow {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  font-size: 2rem;
  color: var(--color-primary);
  opacity: 0.8;
  align-self: center;
  --arrow-rotation: 90deg;
  margin: var(--space-xs) 0;
}

.workflow-step__arrow--1 { grid-area: arrow1; }
.workflow-step__arrow--2 { grid-area: arrow2; }
.workflow-step__arrow--3 { grid-area: arrow3; }

@media (min-width: 768px) {
  .workflow-step__arrow--1 { --arrow-rotation: 0deg; }
  .workflow-step__arrow--2 { --arrow-rotation: 130deg; margin: var(--space-md) 0; }
  .workflow-step__arrow--3 { --arrow-rotation: 0deg; }
}

@media (min-width: 1200px) {
  .workflow-step__arrow { --arrow-rotation: 0deg; margin: 0; }
}

.workflow-step__number {
  font-family: var(--font-headings);
  font-size: var(--text-lg);
  font-weight: 800;
  color: var(--step-color);
  line-height: 1;
}

.workflow-step__icon {
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  color: var(--step-color);
  margin: var(--space-xs) 0;
}

@media (min-width: 820px) {
  .workflow-step__icon { font-size: 2rem; }
}

.workflow-step__title {
  font-family: var(--font-headings);
  font-size: var(--text-base);
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--color-text);
  line-height: 1.2;
  width: 90%;
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
}

.workflow-step__duration {
  font-family: var(--font-primary);
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  font-weight: 600;
  color: var(--step-color);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 1px;
  margin-bottom: var(--space-lg);
  padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm);
  background-color: transparent;
  border: 1px solid var(--step-color);
  display: inline-block;
  text-align: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
}

.workflow-step__list {
  list-style: none;
  padding: 0;
  margin: 0;
  flex: 1;
}

.workflow-step__list :global(li) {
  font-family: var(--font-primary);
  font-size: var(--text-sm);
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  padding: var(--space-sm) 0;
  position: relative;
  padding-left: var(--space-lg);
  line-height: 1.5;
  text-align: left;
}

.workflow-step__list :global(li::before) {
  content: '✓';
  position: absolute;
  left: 0;
  top: var(--space-sm);
  color: var(--step-color);
  font-weight: bold;
  font-size: var(--text-xs);
  width: 16px;
  height: 16px;
  border-radius: 50%;
  background-color: var(--step-bg);
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
}

.workflow-step__circle--1,
.workflow-step__content--1,
.workflow-step__arrow--1 {
  --step-color: var(--color-primary);
  --step-bg: #ffe0f0;
}

.workflow-step__circle--2,
.workflow-step__content--2,
.workflow-step__arrow--2 {
  --step-color: var(--color-secondary);
  --step-bg: #e9d5ff;
}

.workflow-step__circle--3,
.workflow-step__content--3,
.workflow-step__arrow--3 {
  --step-color: var(--color-teal);
  --step-bg: rgba(var(--color-teal-rgb), 0.1);
}

.workflow-step__circle--4,
.workflow-step__content--4 {
  --step-color: var(--color-warning);
  --step-bg: rgba(var(--color-warning-rgb), 0.1);
}

.workflow-step__circle--1,
.workflow-step__circle--2,
.workflow-step__circle--4 {
  border-color: var(--step-color);
}

.workflow-step__circle--1 :global(.workflow-step__number),
.workflow-step__circle--1 :global(.workflow-step__icon),
.workflow-step__circle--2 :global(.workflow-step__number),
.workflow-step__circle--2 :global(.workflow-step__icon),
.workflow-step__circle--4 :global(.workflow-step__number),
.workflow-step__circle--4 :global(.workflow-step__icon) {
  color: var(--step-color);
}

.workflow-step__circle--3 {
  border-color: var(--step-color);
}

.workflow-step__circle--3 :global(.workflow-step__number),
.workflow-step__circle--3 :global(.workflow-step__icon) {
  color: var(--step-color);
}

.workflow-step__content--1,
.workflow-step__content--2,
.workflow-step__content--3,
.workflow-step__content--4 {
  border-color: var(--step-color);
}

.workflow-step__content--1 :global(.workflow-step__duration),
.workflow-step__content--2 :global(.workflow-step__duration),
.workflow-step__content--3 :global(.workflow-step__duration),
.workflow-step__content--4 :global(.workflow-step__duration) {
  background-color: transparent;
  border-color: var(--step-color);
  color: var(--step-color);
}

.workflow-step__content--1 :global(.workflow-step__list li::before),
.workflow-step__content--2 :global(.workflow-step__list li::before),
.workflow-step__content--3 :global(.workflow-step__list li::before),
.workflow-step__content--4 :global(.workflow-step__list li::before) {
  background-color: var(--step-bg);
  color: var(--step-color);
}

.workflow-step__arrow--1,
.workflow-step__arrow--2,
.workflow-step__arrow--3 {
  color: var(--step-color);
}

.workflow-footer {
  text-align: center;
  margin-top: var(--space-2xl);
}

.workflow-footer__message {
  font-family: var(--font-primary);
  font-size: var(--text-lg);
  color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  max-width: 1000px;
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
  line-height: 1.6;
}
</style>
